 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-- **Input:** A 3D scalar field (voxel grid) of dimensions $N_x \times N_y \times N_z$, typically generated via procedural noise or loaded from a texture. A target isovalue $\tau$ (default 0.0) [S2, unofficial].
